{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/heading_text_far_from_dead.png?t=1740148388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FAR FROM DEAD</strong> is a fast paced run 'n gun boss rush game by Brian O'Keefe. Take control of your destiny and fight your way through foes who would stop at nothing to prevent you from attaining true freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/gif_dm_1_616.gif?t=1740148388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/heading_text_features.png?t=1740148388\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEVEN UNIQUE BOSSES</strong>: Each boss has a distinctive and devastating set of tricks and traps to stop you. Learn their patterns and conquer all seven to earn your victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BOB AND WEAVE</strong>: Master the art of dashing through attacks and wall jumping to evade your foes. Then, strike back with your trusty handgun.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/gif_ll_1_616.gif?t=1740148388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRY, TRY AGAIN</strong>: While failure is expected, each fight is concise, meaning you'll never be set back too far. Find your flow state and push past the finish line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TOUGH, BUT FAIR</strong>: Need a hand? Use the included Assist Mode to fine-tune the difficulty of your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HANDCRAFTED</strong>: Experience hand-pixeled art and an original chiptune soundtrack.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/gif_dr_1_616.gif?t=1740148388\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1042320?t=1740148388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740148388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/1399397a411629384d7c7c0bac0a8f15b052921b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740148388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/1399397a411629384d7c7c0bac0a8f15b052921b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740148388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/heading_text_far_from_dead.png?t=1740148388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FAR FROM DEAD</strong> is a fast paced run 'n gun boss rush game by Brian O'Keefe. Take control of your destiny and fight your way through foes who would stop at nothing to prevent you from attaining true freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/gif_dm_1_616.gif?t=1740148388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/heading_text_features.png?t=1740148388\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_